Subtask 2.3: Build a Custom JMX Monitoring Tool
Create a standalone Java class that connects to the running application's platform MBean server (since it runs in the same JVM environment for this lab, we query it in-process using a second, short-lived instance is not possible for a truly separate JVM connection without RMI; instead we connect remotely over the JMX RMI connector we just enabled).

